Génn bind: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), taxaw.
Génn bind: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), taxaw.
Génn bind: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), taxaw.
Génn bind: ([''] tccompare: ['']), taxaw.
